{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R6f8jDRW2FVVBQtK3bcv47","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心reframe：从''strategy×phase interaction''转向''phase-dependent\n2\t  amplification of compound sparsity''。\n3\t\n4\t  Phase gradient本身成立且跨模型/benchmark稳健，但importance vs random的区分在多数条件下模糊。\n5\t\n6\t  Strategy specificity降为secondary finding限定于DeepSeek+高sparsity+MATH-500。\n7\t\n8\t  论文C1改为''compound sparsity severity is phase-modulated''（drop strategy-modulated作为co-equal\n9\t  claim）；\n10\t\n11\t  Crossover（C3）仍成立但解释为''magnitude difference''而非''qualitative strategy divergence''；\n12\t\n13\t  仍冲EMNLP：phase-dependent compound degradation本身是新发现且practical implications不变。\n14\t\n15\t  '\n16\timagined_experiments:\n17\t- name: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n18\t  plan_id: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n19\t  description: 'LLaMA-8B n=250 cross-architecture replication: 8 conditions (imp+rand\n20\t    × 4 sparsities)'\n21\t  expected_results:\n22\t    n_problems: 250\n23\t    n_valid: 247\n24\t    conditions_completed: 8/8\n25\t    n_bootstrap: 10000\n26\t    bonferroni_k: 4\n27\t    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n28\t      s015: 0.11\n29\t      s020: 0.14\n30\t      s025: 0.18\n31\t      s030: 0.22\n32\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n33\t      s015:\n34\t      - -0.04\n35\t      - 0.27\n36\t      s020:\n37\t      - -0.02\n38\t      - 0.3\n39\t      s025:\n40\t      - 0.02\n41\t      - 0.35\n42\t      s030:\n43\t      - 0.05\n44\t      - 0.39\n45\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n46\t      s015: negligible\n47\t      s020: negligible\n48\t      s025: negligible\n49\t      s030: small\n50\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n51\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n52\t      s015: 0.92\n53\t      s020: 1.01\n54\t      s025: 1.05\n55\t      s030: 0.97\n56\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci:\n57\t      s015:\n58\t      - 0.68\n59\t      - 1.18\n60\t      s020:\n61\t      - 0.78\n62\t      - 1.25\n63\t      s025:\n64\t      - 0.82\n65\t      - 1.3\n66\t      s030:\n67\t      - 0.74\n68\t      - 1.22\n69\t    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n70\t    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n71\t      s015: 0.52\n72\t      s020: 0.58\n73\t      s025: 0.65\n74\t      s030: 0.72\n75\t    phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n76\t      s015:\n77\t      - 0.31\n78\t      - 0.74\n79\t      s020:\n80\t      - 0.37\n81\t      - 0.8\n82\t      s025:\n83\t      - 0.44\n84\t      - 0.87\n85\t      s030:\n86\t      - 0.51\n87\t      - 0.93\n88\t    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_medium\n89\t    median_diff_imp_vs_rand:\n90\t      s015: 0.012\n91\t      s020: 0.018\n92\t      s025: 0.045\n93\t      s030: 0.098\n94\t    wilcoxon_p:\n95\t      s015: 0.21\n96\t      s020: 0.14\n97\t      s025: 0.08\n98\t      s030: 0.04\n99\t    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n100\t      s015: 0.84\n101\t      s020: 0.56\n102\t      s025: 0.32\n103\t      s030: 0.16\n104\t    significant_bonferroni:\n105\t      s015: false\n106\t      s020: false\n107\t      s025: false\n108\t      s030: false\n109\t    dose_response_importance_monotonic: true\n110\t    dose_response_importance_spearman_rho: 1.0\n111\t    dose_response_random_monotonic: true\n112\t    dose_response_random_spearman_rho: 1.0\n113\t    imp_rand_ratio_median_gradient: 1.3-1.8x\n114\t  result_rationale: 'n=250提供了比n=50高得多的统计功效（可检测d≈0.18的效应），但即使如此imp_vs_rand d_z仍然<0.25。\n115\t\n116\t    这意味着LLaMA上importance与random之间的真实效应量确实极小——n=50时观察到的d_z 0.19-0.34部分是\n117\t\n118\t    噪声驱动的高估（regression to the mean）。增加样本量后估计值收缩到0.11-0.22。\n119\t\n120\t    关键发现：random phase gradient d_z在0.52-0.72范围，是medium效应量，与n=50数据（0.35-0.44）\n121\t\n122\t    方向一致但更精确。这意味着在LLaMA架构上，compound sparsity的phase-dependent amplification\n123\t\n124\t    是一个普遍现象，不依赖于eviction strategy。机制解释：LLaMA的GQA（Grouped Query Attention）\n125\t\n126\t    结构导致head pruning后剩余heads的attention distribution变化对所有eviction strategy产生\n127\t\n128\t    类似的phase-dependent degradation——information-dense reasoning phases无论用什么strategy\n129\t\n130\t    剔除KV cache都会受到更大的compound损伤。Bonferroni校正后0/4显著，确认strategy×phase\n131\t\n132\t    interaction在LLaMA上不是可靠发现。\n133\t\n134\t    '\n135\t  tables:\n136\t  - title: 'Table: LLaMA n=250 Phase Gradient Comparison (worst tier)'\n137\t    columns:\n138\t    - Sparsity\n139\t    - Imp d_z\n140\t    - Rand d_z\n141\t    - Imp-Rand d_z\n142\t    - Bonf. sig?\n143\t    rows:\n144\t    - - s015\n145\t      - '0.92'\n146\t      - '0.52'\n147\t      - '0.11'\n148\t      - 'No'\n149\t    - - s020\n150\t      - '1.01'\n151\t      - '0.58'\n152\t      - '0.14'\n153\t      - 'No'\n154\t    - - s025\n155\t      - '1.05'\n156\t      - '0.65'\n157\t      - '0.18'\n158\t      - 'No'\n159\t    - - s030\n160\t      - '0.97'\n161\t      - '0.72'\n162\t      - '0.22'\n163\t      - 'No'\n164\t  figures_description:\n165\t  - 'Fig: Phase gradient comparison showing importance (solid) and random (dashed)\n166\t    d_z values across sparsity levels. Both lines rise together with only ~0.3-0.4\n167\t    d_z gap, far smaller than the 0.6-0.8 gap seen in DeepSeek. Error bars (95% CI)\n168\t    heavily overlap.'\n169\t  analysis: \"LLaMA n=250数据定性确认了n=50的发现但更精确：(1) within-importance phase gradient依然large（d_z≈1.0），\\n\\\n170\t    确认phase-dependent compound amplification是跨架构的；(2) 但random phase gradient也是medium（d_z≈0.6），\\n\\\n171\t    且imp_vs_rand差异全部Bonferroni NS。这强力支持worst-tier叙事：phase modulation是universal的，\\n\\\n172\t    strategy specificity不是。对论文影响：C8必须从\\\"partially confirmed\\\"降级为\\\"direction consistent\\\n173\t    \\ only\\\"，\\n且明确陈述\\\"strategy×phase interaction strength is architecture-dependent\\\n174\t    \\ and not reliably detected \\non LLaMA even at n=250\\\"。\\n\"\n175\t- name: c8_llama_gpu0_s025\n176\t  plan_id: c8_llama_gpu0_s025\n177\t  description: LLaMA s025单条件加速跑（GPU0 preemptive），为n=250提供partial early results\n178\t  expected_results:\n179\t    n_problems: 250\n180\t    condition: importance_s025\n181\t    phase_gradient_dz: 1.05\n182\t    phase_gradient_dz_ci:\n183\t    - 0.82\n184\t    - 1.3\n185\t    median_ii_low: 2.85\n186\t    median_ii_high: 0.42\n187\t    median_diff: 2.43\n188\t    median_diff_ci:\n189\t    - 1.65\n190\t    - 3.28\n191\t    wilcoxon_p: 1.2e-18\n192\t    interpretation: strong within-importance phase gradient confirmed\n193\t  result_rationale: '这是c8_llama_n250_fixed的子集数据（仅importance s025条件），在GPU0上提前跑以获得early\n194\t    signal。\n195\t\n196\t    在worst tier下，within-importance gradient仍然strong（d_z≈1.05），因为phase modulation本身\n197\t\n198\t    是universal的——问题不在于importance是否有phase gradient，而在于random是否也有。\n199\t\n200\t    单独看importance s025的数据会让人误以为结果很好，但需要等random条件完成才能评估strategy specificity。\n201\t\n202\t    '\n203\t  tables: []\n204\t  figures_description: []\n205\t  analysis: 'GPU0加速结果单独看是\"positive\"（importance gradient strong），但在worst tier下这不是\n206\t\n207\t    differentiating evidence——因为random条件也会显示medium gradient。此数据的主要价值是\n208\t\n209\t    确认LLaMA n=250实验的pipeline功能正常。\n210\t\n211\t    '\n212\t- name: c10_lang_s020_s025\n213\t  plan_id: c10_lang_s020_s025\n214\t  description: DS MATH-500 language switching analysis at intermediate sparsities\n215\t    s020/s025\n216\t  expected_results:\n217\t    n_problems: 50\n218\t    s020:\n219\t      switch_rate: 0.12\n220\t      cn_count: 6\n221\t      en_count: 44\n222\t      cn_acc: 0.0\n223\t      en_acc: 0.3\n224\t      avg_cn_token_ratio: 0.35\n225\t    s025:\n226\t      switch_rate: 0.26\n227\t      cn_count: 13\n228\t      en_count: 37\n229\t      cn_acc: 0.08\n230\t      en_acc: 0.08\n231\t      avg_cn_token_ratio: 0.52\n232\t    trend_full: 0% (dense) → 4% (s015) → 12% (s020) → 26% (s025) → 40% (s030)\n233\t    monotonic: true\n234\t  result_rationale: 'Language switching是compound degradation的一个行为层面的表现——当compound\n235\t    sparsity足够高时，\n236\t\n237\t    DeepSeek-R1-Distill（原始训练数据含中文）会退化到中文推理。这个现象在worst tier下不受影响，\n238\t\n239\t    因为它不涉及strategy specificity问题——它只是compound severity递增的behavioral correlate。\n240\t\n241\t    s020（12%）和s025（26%）填充了s015（4%）到s030（40%）之间的dose-response曲线。\n242\t\n243\t    monotonic递增与II median_diff的dose-response一致。在worst tier下，这个实验的结论不变：\n244\t\n245\t    compound sparsity severity递增导致behavioral degradation（包括language switching）递增。\n246\t\n247\t    但它不能用来支持strategy specificity claim——它只用了importance条件。\n248\t\n249\t    '\n250\t  tables:\n251\t  - title: 'Table: Language Switching Dose-Response (DS, MATH-500)'\n252\t    columns:\n253\t    - Sparsity\n254\t    - Switch Rate\n255\t    - CN Count\n256\t    - EN Acc\n257\t    - CN Acc\n258\t    rows:\n259\t    - - dense\n260\t      - 0%\n261\t      - '0'\n262\t      - '0.52'\n263\t      - —\n264\t    - - s015\n265\t      - 4%\n266\t      - '2'\n267\t      - '0.375'\n268\t      - '0.0'\n269\t    - - s020\n270\t      - 12%\n271\t      - '6'\n272\t      - '0.30'\n273\t      - '0.0'\n274\t    - - s025\n275\t      - 26%\n276\t      - '13'\n277\t      - '0.08'\n278\t      - '0.08'\n279\t    - - s030\n280\t      - 40%\n281\t      - '20'\n282\t      - '0.10'\n283\t      - '0.10'\n284\t  figures_description:\n285\t  - 'Fig: Monotonically increasing language switching rate vs sparsity level, with\n286\t    accuracy decline overlay. Both curves show smooth dose-response without plateau.'\n287\t  analysis: 'Language switching数据在worst tier下完全可用——它支持C2（phase-modulated severity）和C6\n288\t\n289\t    （sub-exponential growth），不依赖strategy specificity。可在论文§5 Discussion中作为\n290\t\n291\t    compound degradation的qualitative behavioral evidence，补充perplexity-based II metric。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n295\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n296\t  description: 'GPQA Diamond benchmark: DS importance s015 pilot — 测试非数学推理的phase gradient'\n297\t  expected_results:\n298\t    n_problems: 50\n299\t    benchmark: GPQA Diamond\n300\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n301\t    strategy: importance\n302\t    sparsity: 0.15\n303\t    phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.18\n304\t    phase_gradient_ci:\n305\t    - 0.04\n306\t    - 0.35\n307\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.012\n308\t    ii_high_median: 0.008\n309\t    ii_mid_median: 0.052\n310\t    ii_low_median: 0.19\n311\t    phase_distribution:\n312\t      high_tokens: 8500\n313\t      mid_tokens: 12000\n314\t      low_tokens: 18500\n315\t    dense_accuracy: 0.38\n316\t    s015_accuracy: 0.32\n317\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond是研究生级别的科学推理题，推理链通常比MATH-500更长且更复杂。在worst tier下：\n318\t\n319\t    (1) Phase gradient仍然存在（median_diff=0.18, p=0.012显著），确认phase modulation在\n320\t\n321\t    非数学benchmark上成立；(2) 但效应量远小于MATH-500同条件（DS s015 MATH-500 median_diff=0.39，\n322\t\n323\t    GPQA只有0.18，约为一半）。这本身不构成worst tier的核心打击——真正的问题是当后续跑random条件时，\n324\t\n325\t    GPQA上importance/random ratio会<2×。s015是pilot，效应量已经小意味着在更高sparsity下\n326\t\n327\t    即使importance gradient增大，random也会同步增大，导致ratio始终在1.0-1.9×范围。\n328\t\n329\t    原因：GPQA的推理链更distributed、attention pattern更uniform，导致importance score的\n330\t\n331\t    discrimination本身就比MATH-500弱——即head pruning后的Gini collapse更严重，\n332\t\n333\t    importance eviction更快退化为pseudo-random。\n334\t\n335\t    '\n336\t  tables:\n337\t  - title: 'Table: GPQA vs MATH-500 Phase Gradient Comparison (DS, s015, importance)'\n338\t    columns:\n339\t    - Benchmark\n340\t    - median_diff\n341\t    - II_low\n342\t    - II_high\n343\t    - ratio (low/high)\n344\t    rows:\n345\t    - - MATH-500\n346\t      - '0.39'\n347\t      - '0.398'\n348\t      - '0.006'\n349\t      - 66×\n350\t    - - GPQA Diamond\n351\t      - '0.18'\n352\t      - '0.190'\n353\t      - '0.008'\n354\t      - 24×\n355\t  figures_description:\n356\t  - 'Fig: Side-by-side phase gradient at s015 for MATH-500 vs GPQA. Both show positive\n357\t    gradient but GPQA magnitude is ~50% of MATH-500.'\n358\t  analysis: 'GPQA pilot确认phase modulation的跨benchmark泛化（C10方向），但效应量缩减暗示在该benchmark上\n359\t\n360\t    strategy specificity将更弱。这是worst tier的关键预测：跨benchmark时phase gradient universal\n361\t\n362\t    但strategy specificity shrinks。论文需要在§6 Discussion诚实报告：\"Phase modulation generalizes\n363\t\n364\t    to non-mathematical reasoning, but strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent.\"\n365\t\n366\t    '\n367\t- name: gpqa_full_battery\n368\t  plan_id: 线路A_GPQA_Diamond\n369\t  description: 'GPQA Diamond full: DS+QW × importance × 4 sparsities + 2 random controls\n370\t    = 10 runs'\n371\t  expected_results:\n372\t    ds_importance:\n373\t      s015:\n374\t        median_gradient: 0.18\n375\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.012\n376\t      s020:\n377\t        median_gradient: 0.52\n378\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.003\n379\t      s025:\n380\t        median_gradient: 1.35\n381\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0002\n382\t      s030:\n383\t        median_gradient: 2.89\n384\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n385\t    ds_random:\n386\t      s025:\n387\t        median_gradient: 0.92\n388\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n389\t      s030:\n390\t        median_gradient: 1.85\n391\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.003\n392\t    qw_importance:\n393\t      s015:\n394\t        median_gradient: 0.02\n395\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.31\n396\t      s020:\n397\t        median_gradient: 0.11\n398\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.045\n399\t      s025:\n400\t        median_gradient: 0.58\n401\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.001\n402\t      s030:\n403\t        median_gradient: 1.42\n404\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n405\t    qw_random:\n406\t      s025:\n407\t        median_gradient: 0.41\n408\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n409\t      s030:\n410\t        median_gradient: 0.95\n411\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.006\n412\t    strategy_specificity_ratio:\n413\t      ds_s025: 1.47\n414\t      ds_s030: 1.56\n415\t      qw_s025: 1.41\n416\t      qw_s030: 1.49\n417\t    cross_benchmark_comparison:\n418\t      math500_ratio_range: 2.7-36×\n419\t      gsm8k_ratio_range: 2.3-3.8×\n420\t      gpqa_ratio_range: 1.4-1.6×\n421\t    dose_response_monotonic_importance: true\n422\t    dose_response_monotonic_random: true\n423\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond上strategy specificity ratio全面崩塌到<2×，这是worst tier的核心证据。原因链：\n424\t\n425\t    (1) GPQA推理更复杂→attention pattern更distributed→importance score baseline discrimination更低；\n426\t\n427\t    (2) Head pruning后Gini collapse更严重→importance eviction质量下降更多；\n428\t\n429\t    (3) 结果：importance和random eviction在GPQA上产生的compound interaction差异缩小到1.4-1.6×。\n430\t\n431\t\n432\t    注意：phase gradient本身对两种strategy都是单调递增的（importance和random都有dose-response），\n433\t\n434\t    这进一步支持worst tier的核心论点——phase modulation是universal的，strategy specificity不是。\n435\t\n436\t\n437\t    关键对比：MATH-500 ratio 15-36×（DS n=500）→ GSM8K 2.3-3.8× → GPQA 1.4-1.6×。\n438\t\n439\t    随着task complexity增加，strategy specificity单调递减。这暗示strategy specificity\n440\t\n441\t    主要是\"easy tasks with clear attention patterns\"的特有属性，不是compound sparsity的\n442\t\n443\t    fundamental property。论文的novelty pitch必须从三维交互降级。\n444\t\n445\t    '\n446\t  tables:\n447\t  - title: 'Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks (worst tier)'\n448\t    columns:\n449\t    - Benchmark\n450\t    - Task Type\n451\t    - DS ratio\n452\t    - QW ratio\n453\t    - Interpretation\n454\t    rows:\n455\t    - - MATH-500\n456\t      - Math reasoning\n457\t      - 15-36×\n458\t      - 2.7-20×\n459\t      - Strong specificity\n460\t    - - GSM8K\n461\t      - Easy math\n462\t      - 2.3-3.8×\n463\t      - ~2×\n464\t      - Weak specificity\n465\t    - - GPQA Diamond\n466\t      - Science reasoning\n467\t      - 1.5-1.6×\n468\t      - 1.4-1.5×\n469\t      - No meaningful specificity\n470\t  figures_description:\n471\t  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity ratio vs benchmark complexity. Clear monotonic decline\n472\t    from MATH-500 (high ratio) through GSM8K (medium) to GPQA (near 1.0). Shaded region\n473\t    below 2× marked as ''no practical distinction''.'\n474\t  analysis: 'GPQA结果是worst tier的杀手锏：它表明strategy specificity不是compound sparsity的intrinsic\n475\t    property，\n476\t\n477\t    而是task-benchmark-specific artifact。Phase modulation remains robust（所有条件gradient单调），\n478\t\n479\t    但\"importance is special\"的claim被严重削弱。论文必须reframe：C1从\"strategy- and task-modulated\"\n480\t\n481\t    改为\"phase-modulated; strategy modulation limited to specific task-architecture\n482\t    combinations\"。\n483\t\n484\t    EMNLP submission仍可行但novelty pitch缩窄。\n485\t\n486\t    '\n487\t- name: 14b_scale_validation\n488\t  plan_id: 线路B_14B_model\n489\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct × MATH-500 × importance × 4 sparsities + 1 random\n490\t    control\n491\t  expected_results:\n492\t    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n493\t    n_problems: 50\n494\t    importance:\n495\t      s015:\n496\t        median_gradient: 0.04\n497\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.08\n498\t      s020:\n499\t        median_gradient: 0.19\n500\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.005\n501\t      s025:\n502\t        median_gradient: 0.72\n503\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n504\t      s030:\n505\t        median_gradient: 1.85\n506\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n507\t    random_s025:\n508\t      median_gradient: 0.38\n509\t      wilcoxon_p: 0.015\n510\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_s025: 1.89\n511\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n512\t    dense_accuracy: 0.58\n513\t    s030_accuracy: 0.28\n514\t    cohens_d_range: 0.28-0.95\n515\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n516\t      s015: 0.45\n517\t      s020: 0.62\n518\t      s025: 0.78\n519\t      s030: 0.88\n520\t  result_rationale: '14B模型的redundancy更高（更多heads、更宽的attention），这意味着：\n521\t\n522\t    (1) 同样的pruning ratio对14B的相对影响更小→absolute gradient magnitude小于7B；\n523\t\n524\t    (2) 但phase modulation方向一致（gradient仍单调递增）；\n525\t\n526\t    (3) Strategy specificity ratio在14B上也<2×——因为14B有更多冗余heads，pruning后\n527\t\n528\t    剩余heads足以维持reasonable discrimination，导致importance和random的差异缩小。\n529\t\n530\t\n531\t    Worst tier解释：更大的模型有更多architectural redundancy，head pruning的marginal impact\n532\t\n533\t    被缓冲。这表明phase-modulated compound severity在small models上被放大（7B更susceptible），\n534\t\n535\t    而strategy specificity在任何model scale上都不robust。\n536\t\n537\t\n538\t    对论文影响：C5（cross-model generalization）方向confirmed但magnitude大幅缩减。\n539\t\n540\t    7B-only results不能直接外推到production-scale models。Limitations section必须诚实声明。\n541\t\n542\t    '\n543\t  tables:\n544\t  - title: 'Table: 14B vs 7B Phase Gradient Comparison (importance, MATH-500)'\n545\t    columns:\n546\t    - Model\n547\t    - s015\n548\t    - s020\n549\t    - s025\n550\t    - s030\n551\t    rows:\n552\t    - - DS-7B\n553\t      - '0.39'\n554\t      - '1.21'\n555\t      - '3.99'\n556\t      - '8.48'\n557\t    - - QW-7B\n558\t      - '0.07'\n559\t      - '0.31'\n560\t      - '1.07'\n561\t      - '3.16'\n562\t    - - QW-14B\n563\t      - '0.04'\n564\t      - '0.19'\n565\t      - '0.72'\n566\t      - '1.85'\n567\t  figures_description:\n568\t  - 'Fig: Phase gradient magnitude vs model scale (7B vs 14B) at each sparsity level.\n569\t    14B values consistently ~50-60% of 7B, suggesting inverse relationship between\n570\t    model capacity and compound vulnerability.'\n571\t  analysis: '14B数据在worst tier下进一步削弱novelty：(1) Gradient magnitude随model scale递减，\n572\t\n573\t    暗示在64B/405B级production模型上效应可能negligible；(2) Strategy specificity仍然<2×。\n574\t\n575\t    论文Limitations需要：\" Our findings are strongest at 7B scale; the 14B pilot suggests\n576\t\n577\t    effect magnitude inversely correlates with model capacity, and production-scale\n578\t    models\n579\t\n580\t    may exhibit substantially reduced compound vulnerability.\"\n581\t\n582\t    '\n583\t- name: c5_per_phase_gini_interaction\n584\t  plan_id: mechanism_gini_interaction\n585\t  description: 'Gini collapse × II correlation analysis: 检验discrimination collapse是否差异化驱动strategy\n586\t    specificity'\n587\t  expected_results:\n588\t    ds_importance_gini_ii_correlation:\n589\t      s015: 0.22\n590\t      s020: 0.28\n591\t      s025: 0.31\n592\t      s030: 0.35\n593\t    ds_random_gini_ii_correlation:\n594\t      s015: 0.18\n595\t      s020: 0.24\n596\t      s025: 0.27\n597\t      s030: 0.32\n598\t    qw_importance_gini_ii_correlation:\n599\t      s015: 0.12\n600\t      s020: 0.19\n601\t      s025: 0.25\n602\t      s030: 0.29\n603\t    gini_delta_imp_vs_rand_ttest_p:\n604\t      ds_s015: 0.82\n605\t      ds_s020: 0.65\n606\t      ds_s025: 0.41\n607\t      ds_s030: 0.28\n608\t      qw_s015: 0.91\n609\t      qw_s020: 0.73\n610\t      qw_s025: 0.55\n611\t      qw_s030: 0.38\n612\t    overall_gini_interaction_correlation: 0.26\n613\t    imp_rand_gini_difference_significant: false\n614\t  result_rationale: '在worst tier下，Gini collapse在importance和random之间差异不显著（所有t-test\n615\t    p>0.28）。\n616\t\n617\t    两种strategy都导致discrimination collapse（Gini下降），importance只是多drop 0.01-0.02——\n618\t\n619\t    这在统计上不可区分（n=30 problems, per-phase 分析进一步降低effective n）。\n620\t\n621\t\n622\t    Gini×II correlation存在但weak（r≈0.26），且importance和random的correlation pattern\n623\t\n624\t    几乎相同——这意味着discrimination collapse是head pruning的universal consequence，\n625\t\n626\t    不是importance-specific的。机制reframe：head pruning导致所有surviving heads的attention\n627\t\n628\t    score distribution变得更uniform（Gini下降），这种uniform化在information-dense phases\n629\t\n630\t    影响更大（因为这些phases需要更selective的attention），导致compound interaction在low-sparsity\n631\t\n632\t    phases被放大——但这个amplification对任何eviction strategy都成立。\n633\t\n634\t\n635\t    Correlation范围0.1-0.39对应worst tier的key metric range。\n636\t\n637\t    '\n638\t  tables:\n639\t  - title: 'Table: Gini Delta (importance vs random) — No Significant Difference'\n640\t    columns:\n641\t    - Model\n642\t    - Sparsity\n643\t    - Imp Gini Δ\n644\t    - Rand Gini Δ\n645\t    - Difference\n646\t    - p-value\n647\t    rows:\n648\t    - - DS\n649\t      - s015\n650\t      - '-0.030'\n651\t      - '-0.031'\n652\t      - '+0.001'\n653\t      - '0.82'\n654\t    - - DS\n655\t      - s020\n656\t      - '-0.040'\n657\t      - '-0.040'\n658\t      - '0.000'\n659\t      - '0.65'\n660\t    - - DS\n661\t      - s025\n662\t      - '-0.065'\n663\t      - '-0.062'\n664\t      - '-0.003'\n665\t      - '0.41'\n666\t    - - DS\n667\t      - s030\n668\t      - '-0.081'\n669\t      - '-0.073'\n670\t      - '-0.008'\n671\t      - '0.28'\n672\t    - - QW\n673\t      - s015\n674\t      - '-0.010'\n675\t      - '-0.019'\n676\t      - '+0.009'\n677\t      - '0.91'\n678\t    - - QW\n679\t      - s020\n680\t      - '-0.012'\n681\t      - '-0.023'\n682\t      - '+0.011'\n683\t      - '0.73'\n684\t    - - QW\n685\t      - s025\n686\t      - '-0.010'\n687\t      - '-0.034'\n688\t      - '+0.024'\n689\t      - '0.55'\n690\t    - - QW\n691\t      - s030\n692\t      - '-0.020'\n693\t      - '-0.045'\n694\t      - '+0.025'\n695\t      - '0.38'\n696\t  figures_description:\n697\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of per-phase Gini delta vs per-phase II, with importance (blue)\n698\t    and random (red) overlaid. The two clouds heavily overlap, suggesting Gini collapse\n699\t    predicts II magnitude universally, not strategy-specifically.'\n700\t  analysis: 'Mechanism evidence在worst tier下被削弱但不完全失败：discrimination collapse仍然是\n701\t\n702\t    phase-dependent compound amplification的合理机制（correlation存在），只是它不能解释\n703\t\n704\t    为什么importance会比random更严重——因为在多数条件下两者差异不显著。\n705\t\n706\t    C4需要reframe为：\"discrimination collapse explains phase-dependent amplification universally;\n707\t\n708\t    its strategy-selectivity is an architecture-specific secondary effect observed\n709\t    primarily in\n710\t\n711\t    DeepSeek on MATH-500\"。'\n712\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55f30410-6db0-48bf-814f-3fb31e0f38c1","uuid":"c86766ad-668f-4776-a4e7-fcd7f36860b4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:19:44.131Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073742/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心reframe：从''strategy×phase interaction''转向''phase-dependent\n  amplification of compound sparsity''。\n\n  Phase gradient本身成立且跨模型/benchmark稳健，但importance vs random的区分在多数条件下模糊。\n\n  Strategy specificity降为secondary finding限定于DeepSeek+高sparsity+MATH-500。\n\n  论文C1改为''compound sparsity severity is phase-modulated''（drop strategy-modulated作为co-equal\n  claim）；\n\n  Crossover（C3）仍成立但解释为''magnitude difference''而非''qualitative strategy divergence''；\n\n  仍冲EMNLP：phase-dependent compound degradation本身是新发现且practical implications不变。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n  plan_id: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n  description: 'LLaMA-8B n=250 cross-architecture replication: 8 conditions (imp+rand\n    × 4 sparsities)'\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 250\n    n_valid: 247\n    conditions_completed: 8/8\n    n_bootstrap: 10000\n    bonferroni_k: 4\n    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n      s015: 0.11\n      s020: 0.14\n      s025: 0.18\n      s030: 0.22\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - -0.04\n      - 0.27\n      s020:\n      - -0.02\n      - 0.3\n      s025:\n      - 0.02\n      - 0.35\n      s030:\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.39\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n      s015: negligible\n      s020: negligible\n      s025: negligible\n      s030: small\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n      s015: 0.92\n      s020: 1.01\n      s025: 1.05\n      s030: 0.97\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.68\n      - 1.18\n      s020:\n      - 0.78\n      - 1.25\n      s025:\n      - 0.82\n      - 1.3\n      s030:\n      - 0.74\n      - 1.22\n    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n      s015: 0.52\n      s020: 0.58\n      s025: 0.65\n      s030: 0.72\n    phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.74\n      s020:\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.8\n      s025:\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.87\n      s030:\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.93\n    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_medium\n    median_diff_imp_vs_rand:\n      s015: 0.012\n      s020: 0.018\n      s025: 0.045\n      s030: 0.098\n    wilcoxon_p:\n      s015: 0.21\n      s020: 0.14\n      s025: 0.08\n      s030: 0.04\n    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n      s015: 0.84\n      s020: 0.56\n      s025: 0.32\n      s030: 0.16\n    significant_bonferroni:\n      s015: false\n      s020: false\n      s025: false\n      s030: false\n    dose_response_importance_monotonic: true\n    dose_response_importance_spearman_rho: 1.0\n    dose_response_random_monotonic: true\n    dose_response_random_spearman_rho: 1.0\n    imp_rand_ratio_median_gradient: 1.3-1.8x\n  result_rationale: 'n=250提供了比n=50高得多的统计功效（可检测d≈0.18的效应），但即使如此imp_vs_rand d_z仍然<0.25。\n\n    这意味着LLaMA上importance与random之间的真实效应量确实极小——n=50时观察到的d_z 0.19-0.34部分是\n\n    噪声驱动的高估（regression to the mean）。增加样本量后估计值收缩到0.11-0.22。\n\n    关键发现：random phase gradient d_z在0.52-0.72范围，是medium效应量，与n=50数据（0.35-0.44）\n\n    方向一致但更精确。这意味着在LLaMA架构上，compound sparsity的phase-dependent amplification\n\n    是一个普遍现象，不依赖于eviction strategy。机制解释：LLaMA的GQA（Grouped Query Attention）\n\n    结构导致head pruning后剩余heads的attention distribution变化对所有eviction strategy产生\n\n    类似的phase-dependent degradation——information-dense reasoning phases无论用什么strategy\n\n    剔除KV cache都会受到更大的compound损伤。Bonferroni校正后0/4显著，确认strategy×phase\n\n    interaction在LLaMA上不是可靠发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: LLaMA n=250 Phase Gradient Comparison (worst tier)'\n    columns:\n    - Sparsity\n    - Imp d_z\n    - Rand d_z\n    - Imp-Rand d_z\n    - Bonf. sig?\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - '0.92'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.11'\n      - 'No'\n    - - s020\n      - '1.01'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.14'\n      - 'No'\n    - - s025\n      - '1.05'\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.18'\n      - 'No'\n    - - s030\n      - '0.97'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.22'\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Phase gradient comparison showing importance (solid) and random (dashed)\n    d_z values across sparsity levels. Both lines rise together with only ~0.3-0.4\n    d_z gap, far smaller than the 0.6-0.8 gap seen in DeepSeek. Error bars (95% CI)\n    heavily overlap.'\n  analysis: \"LLaMA n=250数据定性确认了n=50的发现但更精确：(1) within-importance phase gradient依然large（d_z≈1.0），\\n\\\n    确认phase-dependent compound amplification是跨架构的；(2) 但random phase gradient也是medium（d_z≈0.6），\\n\\\n    且imp_vs_rand差异全部Bonferroni NS。这强力支持worst-tier叙事：phase modulation是universal的，\\n\\\n    strategy specificity不是。对论文影响：C8必须从\\\"partially confirmed\\\"降级为\\\"direction consistent\\\n    \\ only\\\"，\\n且明确陈述\\\"strategy×phase interaction strength is architecture-dependent\\\n    \\ and not reliably detected \\non LLaMA even at n=250\\\"。\\n\"\n- name: c8_llama_gpu0_s025\n  plan_id: c8_llama_gpu0_s025\n  description: LLaMA s025单条件加速跑（GPU0 preemptive），为n=250提供partial early results\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 250\n    condition: importance_s025\n    phase_gradient_dz: 1.05\n    phase_gradient_dz_ci:\n    - 0.82\n    - 1.3\n    median_ii_low: 2.85\n    median_ii_high: 0.42\n    median_diff: 2.43\n    median_diff_ci:\n    - 1.65\n    - 3.28\n    wilcoxon_p: 1.2e-18\n    interpretation: strong within-importance phase gradient confirmed\n  result_rationale: '这是c8_llama_n250_fixed的子集数据（仅importance s025条件），在GPU0上提前跑以获得early\n    signal。\n\n    在worst tier下，within-importance gradient仍然strong（d_z≈1.05），因为phase modulation本身\n\n    是universal的——问题不在于importance是否有phase gradient，而在于random是否也有。\n\n    单独看importance s025的数据会让人误以为结果很好，但需要等random条件完成才能评估strategy specificity。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'GPU0加速结果单独看是\"positive\"（importance gradient strong），但在worst tier下这不是\n\n    differentiating evidence——因为random条件也会显示medium gradient。此数据的主要价值是\n\n    确认LLaMA n=250实验的pipeline功能正常。\n\n    '\n- name: c10_lang_s020_s025\n  plan_id: c10_lang_s020_s025\n  description: DS MATH-500 language switching analysis at intermediate sparsities\n    s020/s025\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    s020:\n      switch_rate: 0.12\n      cn_count: 6\n      en_count: 44\n      cn_acc: 0.0\n      en_acc: 0.3\n      avg_cn_token_ratio: 0.35\n    s025:\n      switch_rate: 0.26\n      cn_count: 13\n      en_count: 37\n      cn_acc: 0.08\n      en_acc: 0.08\n      avg_cn_token_ratio: 0.52\n    trend_full: 0% (dense) → 4% (s015) → 12% (s020) → 26% (s025) → 40% (s030)\n    monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'Language switching是compound degradation的一个行为层面的表现——当compound\n    sparsity足够高时，\n\n    DeepSeek-R1-Distill（原始训练数据含中文）会退化到中文推理。这个现象在worst tier下不受影响，\n\n    因为它不涉及strategy specificity问题——它只是compound severity递增的behavioral correlate。\n\n    s020（12%）和s025（26%）填充了s015（4%）到s030（40%）之间的dose-response曲线。\n\n    monotonic递增与II median_diff的dose-response一致。在worst tier下，这个实验的结论不变：\n\n    compound sparsity severity递增导致behavioral degradation（包括language switching）递增。\n\n    但它不能用来支持strategy specificity claim——它只用了importance条件。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Language Switching Dose-Response (DS, MATH-500)'\n    columns:\n    - Sparsity\n    - Switch Rate\n    - CN Count\n    - EN Acc\n    - CN Acc\n    rows:\n    - - dense\n      - 0%\n      - '0'\n      - '0.52'\n      - —\n    - - s015\n      - 4%\n      - '2'\n      - '0.375'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - s020\n      - 12%\n      - '6'\n      - '0.30'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - s025\n      - 26%\n      - '13'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.08'\n    - - s030\n      - 40%\n      - '20'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.10'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Monotonically increasing language switching rate vs sparsity level, with\n    accuracy decline overlay. Both curves show smooth dose-response without plateau.'\n  analysis: 'Language switching数据在worst tier下完全可用——它支持C2（phase-modulated severity）和C6\n\n    （sub-exponential growth），不依赖strategy specificity。可在论文§5 Discussion中作为\n\n    compound degradation的qualitative behavioral evidence，补充perplexity-based II metric。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n  description: 'GPQA Diamond benchmark: DS importance s015 pilot — 测试非数学推理的phase gradient'\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    benchmark: GPQA Diamond\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n    strategy: importance\n    sparsity: 0.15\n    phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.18\n    phase_gradient_ci:\n    - 0.04\n    - 0.35\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.012\n    ii_high_median: 0.008\n    ii_mid_median: 0.052\n    ii_low_median: 0.19\n    phase_distribution:\n      high_tokens: 8500\n      mid_tokens: 12000\n      low_tokens: 18500\n    dense_accuracy: 0.38\n    s015_accuracy: 0.32\n  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond是研究生级别的科学推理题，推理链通常比MATH-500更长且更复杂。在worst tier下：\n\n    (1) Phase gradient仍然存在（median_diff=0.18, p=0.012显著），确认phase modulation在\n\n    非数学benchmark上成立；(2) 但效应量远小于MATH-500同条件（DS s015 MATH-500 median_diff=0.39，\n\n    GPQA只有0.18，约为一半）。这本身不构成worst tier的核心打击——真正的问题是当后续跑random条件时，\n\n    GPQA上importance/random ratio会<2×。s015是pilot，效应量已经小意味着在更高sparsity下\n\n    即使importance gradient增大，random也会同步增大，导致ratio始终在1.0-1.9×范围。\n\n    原因：GPQA的推理链更distributed、attention pattern更uniform，导致importance score的\n\n    discrimination本身就比MATH-500弱——即head pruning后的Gini collapse更严重，\n\n    importance eviction更快退化为pseudo-random。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: GPQA vs MATH-500 Phase Gradient Comparison (DS, s015, importance)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - median_diff\n    - II_low\n    - II_high\n    - ratio (low/high)\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.398'\n      - '0.006'\n      - 66×\n    - - GPQA Diamond\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.190'\n      - '0.008'\n      - 24×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Side-by-side phase gradient at s015 for MATH-500 vs GPQA. Both show positive\n    gradient but GPQA magnitude is ~50% of MATH-500.'\n  analysis: 'GPQA pilot确认phase modulation的跨benchmark泛化（C10方向），但效应量缩减暗示在该benchmark上\n\n    strategy specificity将更弱。这是worst tier的关键预测：跨benchmark时phase gradient universal\n\n    但strategy specificity shrinks。论文需要在§6 Discussion诚实报告：\"Phase modulation generalizes\n\n    to non-mathematical reasoning, but strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent.\"\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_full_battery\n  plan_id: 线路A_GPQA_Diamond\n  description: 'GPQA Diamond full: DS+QW × importance × 4 sparsities + 2 random controls\n    = 10 runs'\n  expected_results:\n    ds_importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.18\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.012\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.52\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.003\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 1.35\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0002\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 2.89\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    ds_random:\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.92\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 1.85\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.003\n    qw_importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.02\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.31\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.11\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.045\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.58\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.001\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 1.42\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n    qw_random:\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.41\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 0.95\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.006\n    strategy_specificity_ratio:\n      ds_s025: 1.47\n      ds_s030: 1.56\n      qw_s025: 1.41\n      qw_s030: 1.49\n    cross_benchmark_comparison:\n      math500_ratio_range: 2.7-36×\n      gsm8k_ratio_range: 2.3-3.8×\n      gpqa_ratio_range: 1.4-1.6×\n    dose_response_monotonic_importance: true\n    dose_response_monotonic_random: true\n  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond上strategy specificity ratio全面崩塌到<2×，这是worst tier的核心证据。原因链：\n\n    (1) GPQA推理更复杂→attention pattern更distributed→importance score baseline discrimination更低；\n\n    (2) Head pruning后Gini collapse更严重→importance eviction质量下降更多；\n\n    (3) 结果：importance和random eviction在GPQA上产生的compound interaction差异缩小到1.4-1.6×。\n\n\n    注意：phase gradient本身对两种strategy都是单调递增的（importance和random都有dose-response），\n\n    这进一步支持worst tier的核心论点——phase modulation是universal的，strategy specificity不是。\n\n\n    关键对比：MATH-500 ratio 15-36×（DS n=500）→ GSM8K 2.3-3.8× → GPQA 1.4-1.6×。\n\n    随着task complexity增加，strategy specificity单调递减。这暗示strategy specificity\n\n    主要是\"easy tasks with clear attention patterns\"的特有属性，不是compound sparsity的\n\n    fundamental property。论文的novelty pitch必须从三维交互降级。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks (worst tier)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Task Type\n    - DS ratio\n    - QW ratio\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - Math reasoning\n      - 15-36×\n      - 2.7-20×\n      - Strong specificity\n    - - GSM8K\n      - Easy math\n      - 2.3-3.8×\n      - ~2×\n      - Weak specificity\n    - - GPQA Diamond\n      - Science reasoning\n      - 1.5-1.6×\n      - 1.4-1.5×\n      - No meaningful specificity\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity ratio vs benchmark complexity. Clear monotonic decline\n    from MATH-500 (high ratio) through GSM8K (medium) to GPQA (near 1.0). Shaded region\n    below 2× marked as ''no practical distinction''.'\n  analysis: 'GPQA结果是worst tier的杀手锏：它表明strategy specificity不是compound sparsity的intrinsic\n    property，\n\n    而是task-benchmark-specific artifact。Phase modulation remains robust（所有条件gradient单调），\n\n    但\"importance is special\"的claim被严重削弱。论文必须reframe：C1从\"strategy- and task-modulated\"\n\n    改为\"phase-modulated; strategy modulation limited to specific task-architecture\n    combinations\"。\n\n    EMNLP submission仍可行但novelty pitch缩窄。\n\n    '\n- name: 14b_scale_validation\n  plan_id: 线路B_14B_model\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct × MATH-500 × importance × 4 sparsities + 1 random\n    control\n  expected_results:\n    model: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n    n_problems: 50\n    importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.04\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.08\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.19\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.005\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.72\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 1.85\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    random_s025:\n      median_gradient: 0.38\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.015\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_s025: 1.89\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    dense_accuracy: 0.58\n    s030_accuracy: 0.28\n    cohens_d_range: 0.28-0.95\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n      s015: 0.45\n      s020: 0.62\n      s025: 0.78\n      s030: 0.88\n  result_rationale: '14B模型的redundancy更高（更多heads、更宽的attention），这意味着：\n\n    (1) 同样的pruning ratio对14B的相对影响更小→absolute gradient magnitude小于7B；\n\n    (2) 但phase modulation方向一致（gradient仍单调递增）；\n\n    (3) Strategy specificity ratio在14B上也<2×——因为14B有更多冗余heads，pruning后\n\n    剩余heads足以维持reasonable discrimination，导致importance和random的差异缩小。\n\n\n    Worst tier解释：更大的模型有更多architectural redundancy，head pruning的marginal impact\n\n    被缓冲。这表明phase-modulated compound severity在small models上被放大（7B更susceptible），\n\n    而strategy specificity在任何model scale上都不robust。\n\n\n    对论文影响：C5（cross-model generalization）方向confirmed但magnitude大幅缩减。\n\n    7B-only results不能直接外推到production-scale models。Limitations section必须诚实声明。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: 14B vs 7B Phase Gradient Comparison (importance, MATH-500)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - s015\n    - s020\n    - s025\n    - s030\n    rows:\n    - - DS-7B\n      - '0.39'\n      - '1.21'\n      - '3.99'\n      - '8.48'\n    - - QW-7B\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '1.07'\n      - '3.16'\n    - - QW-14B\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '1.85'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Phase gradient magnitude vs model scale (7B vs 14B) at each sparsity level.\n    14B values consistently ~50-60% of 7B, suggesting inverse relationship between\n    model capacity and compound vulnerability.'\n  analysis: '14B数据在worst tier下进一步削弱novelty：(1) Gradient magnitude随model scale递减，\n\n    暗示在64B/405B级production模型上效应可能negligible；(2) Strategy specificity仍然<2×。\n\n    论文Limitations需要：\" Our findings are strongest at 7B scale; the 14B pilot suggests\n\n    effect magnitude inversely correlates with model capacity, and production-scale\n    models\n\n    may exhibit substantially reduced compound vulnerability.\"\n\n    '\n- name: c5_per_phase_gini_interaction\n  plan_id: mechanism_gini_interaction\n  description: 'Gini collapse × II correlation analysis: 检验discrimination collapse是否差异化驱动strategy\n    specificity'\n  expected_results:\n    ds_importance_gini_ii_correlation:\n      s015: 0.22\n      s020: 0.28\n      s025: 0.31\n      s030: 0.35\n    ds_random_gini_ii_correlation:\n      s015: 0.18\n      s020: 0.24\n      s025: 0.27\n      s030: 0.32\n    qw_importance_gini_ii_correlation:\n      s015: 0.12\n      s020: 0.19\n      s025: 0.25\n      s030: 0.29\n    gini_delta_imp_vs_rand_ttest_p:\n      ds_s015: 0.82\n      ds_s020: 0.65\n      ds_s025: 0.41\n      ds_s030: 0.28\n      qw_s015: 0.91\n      qw_s020: 0.73\n      qw_s025: 0.55\n      qw_s030: 0.38\n    overall_gini_interaction_correlation: 0.26\n    imp_rand_gini_difference_significant: false\n  result_rationale: '在worst tier下，Gini collapse在importance和random之间差异不显著（所有t-test\n    p>0.28）。\n\n    两种strategy都导致discrimination collapse（Gini下降），importance只是多drop 0.01-0.02——\n\n    这在统计上不可区分（n=30 problems, per-phase 分析进一步降低effective n）。\n\n\n    Gini×II correlation存在但weak（r≈0.26），且importance和random的correlation pattern\n\n    几乎相同——这意味着discrimination collapse是head pruning的universal consequence，\n\n    不是importance-specific的。机制reframe：head pruning导致所有surviving heads的attention\n\n    score distribution变得更uniform（Gini下降），这种uniform化在information-dense phases\n\n    影响更大（因为这些phases需要更selective的attention），导致compound interaction在low-sparsity\n\n    phases被放大——但这个amplification对任何eviction strategy都成立。\n\n\n    Correlation范围0.1-0.39对应worst tier的key metric range。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Gini Delta (importance vs random) — No Significant Difference'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Sparsity\n    - Imp Gini Δ\n    - Rand Gini Δ\n    - Difference\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - DS\n      - s015\n      - '-0.030'\n      - '-0.031'\n      - '+0.001'\n      - '0.82'\n    - - DS\n      - s020\n      - '-0.040'\n      - '-0.040'\n      - '0.000'\n      - '0.65'\n    - - DS\n      - s025\n      - '-0.065'\n      - '-0.062'\n      - '-0.003'\n      - '0.41'\n    - - DS\n      - s030\n      - '-0.081'\n      - '-0.073'\n      - '-0.008'\n      - '0.28'\n    - - QW\n      - s015\n      - '-0.010'\n      - '-0.019'\n      - '+0.009'\n      - '0.91'\n    - - QW\n      - s020\n      - '-0.012'\n      - '-0.023'\n      - '+0.011'\n      - '0.73'\n    - - QW\n      - s025\n      - '-0.010'\n      - '-0.034'\n      - '+0.024'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - QW\n      - s030\n      - '-0.020'\n      - '-0.045'\n      - '+0.025'\n      - '0.38'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of per-phase Gini delta vs per-phase II, with importance (blue)\n    and random (red) overlaid. The two clouds heavily overlap, suggesting Gini collapse\n    predicts II magnitude universally, not strategy-specifically.'\n  analysis: 'Mechanism evidence在worst tier下被削弱但不完全失败：discrimination collapse仍然是\n\n    phase-dependent compound amplification的合理机制（correlation存在），只是它不能解释\n\n    为什么importance会比random更严重——因为在多数条件下两者差异不显著。\n\n    C4需要reframe为：\"discrimination collapse explains phase-dependent amplification universally;\n\n    its strategy-selectivity is an architecture-specific secondary effect observed\n    primarily in\n\n    DeepSeek on MATH-500\"。'\n","numLines":712,"startLine":1,"totalLines":712}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LPnQXSi2MbxdfJoiTheu9f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read both the PDF paper and the review context YAML. Let me now dispatch two parallel reviewer agents (R1: methods+experiments, R2: novelty+related work) for independent review, then conduct a roundtable.\n\nLet me structure this as a full DREAM review:\n- R1: Methods + Experiments focus\n- R2: Novelty + Related Work focus\n- Then roundtable: Step 1 independent → Step 2 cross-share → Step 3 converge → Step 4 synthesize\n\nLet me launch both reviewers in parallel.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28386,"cache_read_input_tokens":22952,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28386},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55f30410-6db0-48bf-814f-3fb31e0f38c1","uuid":"bbaeb235-a70f-4ff6-8ec1-5a676be186a2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LPnQXSi2MbxdfJoiTheu9f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've read the paper and review context. Now dispatching two independent reviewers in parallel: R1 (methods + experiments) and R2 (novelty + related work)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28386,"cache_read_input_tokens":22952,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28386},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55f30410-6db0-48bf-814f-3fb31e0f38c1","uuid":"60ac9327-6059-4932-9ddb-5cfd48caae2b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LPnQXSi2MbxdfJoiTheu9f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U2WRc4btzp28LXEEKdHEaT","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R1: Methods + Experiments Review","prompt":"You are Reviewer R1 for a top ML venue review. Your focus: **methods and experiments**. Review the following paper blindly (no knowledge of outcome tiers). Use a 6-point scale (1=Strong Reject, 2=Reject, 3=Weak Reject, 4=Weak Accept, 5=Accept, 6=Strong Accept). Target venue acceptance rate ~25%.\n\n## Paper Summary\n\n**Title:** \"Phase-Dependent Amplification of Compound Sparsity in Long-Chain Reasoning\"\n\n**Core claim:** Compound sparsity (simultaneous head pruning + KV cache eviction) severity is phase-modulated: information-dense reasoning phases suffer disproportionately more compound degradation than computation-light phases, regardless of eviction strategy. Strategy specificity (importance > random) is a secondary, conditional effect.\n\n**Models:** DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B (DS), Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct (QW), DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B (LLaMA), Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct (QW-14B).\n**Benchmarks:** MATH-500, GSM8K, GPQA Diamond.\n**Sparsity levels:** s ∈ {0.15, 0.20, 0.25, 0.30}\n**Eviction strategies:** Importance-based and Random.\n\n## Key Experimental Results\n\n**Table 1 (Primary, MATH-500, importance, n=500):**\n- DS-7B phase gradient: 0.39 → 1.21 → 3.99 → 8.48\n- QW-7B: 0.07 → 0.31 → 1.07 → 3.16\n- All Bonferroni p < 0.005, Cohen's dz 0.61–1.13 (DS), 0.37–1.44 (QW), Spearman ρ = 1.0\n\n**Table 2 (LLaMA n=250, MATH-500):**\n- Importance dz: 0.92, 1.01, 1.05, 0.97 (all large)\n- Random dz: 0.52, 0.58, 0.65, 0.72 (all medium)\n- Imp–Rand dz: 0.11, 0.14, 0.18, 0.22 (negligible–small)\n- 0/4 Bonferroni significant\n\n**Table 3 (GPQA Diamond, n=50):**\n- DS importance: 0.18, 0.52, 1.35, 2.89; DS random (s025/s030 only): 0.92, 1.85\n- QW importance: 0.02, 0.11, 0.58, 1.42; QW random (s025/s030 only): 0.41, 0.95\n\n**Table 4 (Strategy specificity ratio across benchmarks):**\n- MATH-500: DS 15–36×, QW 2.7–20× (Strong)\n- GSM8K: DS 2.3–3.8×, QW ~2× (Weak)\n- GPQA: DS 1.5–1.6×, QW 1.4–1.5× (Negligible)\n\n**Table 5 (MATH-500 vs GPQA at DS imp s=0.15):**\n- MATH-500: median_diff=0.39, II_low/II_high ratio=66×\n- GPQA: median_diff=0.18, ratio=24×\n\n**Table 6 (14B vs 7B, importance, MATH-500):**\n- DS-7B: 0.39, 1.21, 3.99, 8.48\n- QW-7B: 0.07, 0.31, 1.07, 3.16\n- QW-14B: 0.04, 0.19, 0.72, 1.85\n- Strategy specificity ratio at s025 = 1.89× (below 2× threshold)\n- Dense acc drops from 0.58 to 0.28 at s030\n\n**Table 7 (Gini collapse mechanism):**\n- Imp vs Rand Gini delta: no significant difference (all p > 0.28)\n- Overall Gini–II correlation r = 0.26\n- DS importance Gini–II: 0.22–0.35; DS random: 0.18–0.32\n\n**Table 8 (Language switching, DS MATH-500, importance, n=50):**\n- Switch rate: 0% → 4% → 12% → 26% → 40% (monotonic)\n- CN accuracy ≈ 0; EN accuracy drops from 0.52 to 0.10\n\n**Pilot mitigation (Conclusion):** Oracle phase recovery 18%, heuristic 32%, both p < 0.025 but CIs cross zero.\n\n**Appendix A:** LLaMA n=250 detail — confirms regression to mean from n=50 (dz 0.19–0.34 → 0.11–0.22). GQA distributes head removal impact uniformly.\n**Appendix B:** GPQA has 47% low-sparsity tokens vs MATH-500, explaining reduced strategy specificity.\n\n## Review Context (Experimental Design)\nThe full experimental plan includes these experiments:\n1. c8_llama_n250_fixed — LLaMA n=250 full battery (8 conditions). Paper reports this.\n2. c8_llama_gpu0_s025 — LLaMA s025 single-condition accelerated run. Subsumed by #1.\n3. c10_lang_s020_s025 — Language switching at s020/s025. Paper reports this in Table 8.\n4. gpqa_ds_importance_s015 — GPQA pilot. Paper reports as part of Table 3/5.\n5. gpqa_full_battery — GPQA full: DS+QW × imp × 4 sparsities + 2 random controls (10 runs). Paper reports this.\n6. 14b_scale_validation — QW-14B × MATH-500 × 4 sparsities + 1 random control. Paper reports this.\n7. c5_per_phase_gini_interaction — Gini collapse × II correlation analysis. Paper reports in Table 7.\n\nAll planned experiments appear to be covered in the paper.\n\n## Your Task (R1: Methods + Experiments)\n\nEvaluate:\n1. **Experimental design soundness** — Are the baselines appropriate? Is the factorial design sufficient? Are confounds addressed?\n2. **Statistical methodology** — Are the tests appropriate (Wilcoxon, Bonferroni, bootstrap CI, Cohen's dz)? Any concerns about multiple comparisons, power, or effect size interpretation?\n3. **Phase classification validity** — Median attention entropy split — is this principled or arbitrary? Could results be an artifact of the classification scheme?\n4. **Interaction Intensity metric** — Is II = compound_perplexity_increase - (head_pruning_increase + kv_eviction_increase) well-defined? Concerns about additivity assumption?\n5. **Sample sizes** — n=500 for primary, n=250 for LLaMA, n=50 for GPQA/14B. Are the smaller experiments adequately powered?\n6. **Reproducibility** — Is enough detail provided? Missing hyperparameters?\n7. **Coverage gaps** — Are there obvious experiments that should have been run?\n8. **Internal consistency** — Do the numbers add up? Any contradictions?\n9. **Mechanism evidence strength** — r=0.26 for Gini–II. Is this sufficient to claim a mechanism?\n\nProvide your review in this structure:\n- Summary (2-3 sentences)\n- Strengths (bulleted)\n- Weaknesses (bulleted, with severity: major/minor)\n- Questions for Authors\n- Missing Experiments or Analyses\n- Preliminary Score (1-6) with justification\n- Confidence (1-5)\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28386,"cache_read_input_tokens":22952,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28386},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55f30410-6db0-48bf-814f-3fb31e0f38c1","uuid":"1fa5a0e3-39c8-43f0-bbec-dec12d3c410b"}
